{"obsah":"<p>One of this year's longest trips to an exhibition, to Vyšní Lhota, was made by Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček, Tobík Dolák and Marty Kabeláč. The interesting setting attracted a few hundred spectators, who partied at the concerts despite the sweltering heat, and our exhibition was really an adrenaline addition to a rock afternoon and evening. </p>\n\n<p>In two shows they rode both a classic exhibition and a show with egging on for bigger jumps and competitions for spectators. The local hospitality is definitely worth a mention too – we hadn't been so stuffed between exhibitions for a long time. </p>\n\n<p>Thanks for the invitation</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FIMG_5653.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FIMG_5653.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247817\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FIMG_5654.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FIMG_5654.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247818\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FIMG_5655.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2024%2F07%2FIMG_5655.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-247819\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:/